ry.py          # DefectRegistry class\n│   ├── production_analyzer.py      # Arena CSV parser, analyze(), compare_models()\n│   ├── root_cause.py               # Rewritten dynamic correlate()\n│   ├── profitability.py            # compute_financials(), what_if(), impact_delta()\n│   └── ann_surrogate.py            # ANNParser, get_surrogate_engine()\n├── utils/\n│   ├── chart_helpers.py            # All Plotly charts (~464 lines)\n│   └── constants.py                # CORRELATION_RULES, STATION_COLS, thresholds\n└── data/matlab_models/             # 13 parsed .m ANN weight files\n```\n\n### Key Data Structures\n- `analysis` dict (from `analyze(df)`): keys include `stations` (dict of station_name → `{utilization, waiting_time}`), `bottleneck_station` (str), `bottleneck_util` (float 0–1), `bottleneck_wait` (float, minutes), `throughput_gap` (float), `total_parts` (float), `demand` (float), `throughput_efficiency` (float %), `parts_per_hour` (float)\n- `what_if(analysis, defect_sum, scrap_cost, downtime_cost, util_improvement_pct, scrap_reduction_pct, revenue_mult)` → returns same dict shape as `compute_financials()`\n- `compute_financials()` returns: `gross_revenue`, `scrap_loss`, `bottleneck_idle_loss`, `opportunity_loss`, `rework_cost`, `total_loss`, `net_margin`, `margin_pct`, `total_parts`, `good_units`, `scrap_units`, `defect_rate_pct`\n\n### Dataset Facts\n- **Model 1**: 3,000 rows × 22 cols, stations: Drilling/Milling/Assembly, bottleneck: Assembly @77.6%\n- **Model 2**: 3,000 rows × 17 cols, stations: Drilling/Milling/Assembly, bottleneck: Assembly @68.3%\n- **Model 3**: 50,000 rows × 78 cols, 13 stations (Blanking, Press1-4, Cell1-4, Paint1-2, Quality, Forklift), bottleneck: Cell1 @86.7%\n\n### Tab Locations in app.py\n- Tab 1 (Quality Inspection): lines 831–978\n- Tab 2 (Production Flow Health): lines 983–1074 — **TARGET for animated simulator**\n- Tab 3 (Root Cause Analysis): lines 1079+\n- Tab 4 (Profitability & What-If): lines ~1140–1280 — **TARGET for 3D