{"step_index":1255,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-19T21:11:55Z","content":"Check the plan above — once you approve I'll build all three together. A few quick things to confirm:\n\n**On the 3D Surface Plot:** The computation runs a 20×20 grid of `what_if()` calls (400 points) every time the sliders move. It's fast since it's pure Python math — no retraining. The surface literally reshapes as you drag the sliders.\n\n**On the Animation:** It's pure HTML5 Canvas — no extra Python packages needed. It reads the real utilization data from whichever Arena model you've selected, so switching Model 1 → Model 3 completely changes the animation (13 pulsing nodes vs 3).\n\n**On the UI upgrade:** Staying within your existing palette — no harsh neons, all the same executive slate + Plus Jakarta Sans feel, just more polished motion and depth.\n\nSay **go** and I'll build all of it."}
